msgstr "Primjer -- pokretanje povratnog poziva jednom nakon 2 sekunde::"

#: ../../library/machine.Timer.rst:36
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "Konstruktori"

#: ../../library/machine.Timer.rst:40
msgid ""
"Construct a virtual :class:`Timer`. ``id`` must be ``-1`` (the only "
"supported value). Any keyword arguments are forwarded to :meth:`init` so the"
" timer can be configured in a single call."
msgstr ""
"Konstruira virtualni :class:`Timer`\\ . ``id`` mora biti ``-1`` (jedina "
"podržana vrijednost). Svi ključni argumenti prosljeđuju se metodi "
":meth:`init` pa se mjerač vremena može konfigurirati u jednom pozivu."

#: ../../library/machine.Timer.rst:45
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Metode"

#: ../../library/machine.Timer.rst:49
msgid "Initialise / re-initialise the timer."
msgstr "Inicijalizira / ponovno inicijalizira mjerač vremena."

#: ../../library/machine.Timer.rst:51
msgid ""
"``mode`` selects :data:`ONE_SHOT` (fire once and stop) or :data:`PERIODIC` "
"(fire repeatedly)."
msgstr ""
"``mode`` odabire :data:`ONE_SHOT` (okida jednom i staje) ili "
":data:`PERIODIC` (okida opetovano)."

#: ../../library/machine.Timer.rst:53
msgid "``period`` is the period in milliseconds."
msgstr "``period`` je period u milisekundama."

#: ../../library/machine.Timer.rst:54
msgid ""
"``callback`` is invoked when the timer fires. It receives the :class:`Timer`"
" instance as its only argument."
msgstr ""
"``callback`` se poziva kada se mjerač vremena okine. Prima instancu "
":class:`Timer` kao svoj jedini argument."

#: ../../library/machine.Timer.rst:59
msgid "Stop the timer and cancel any pending callback."
msgstr "Zaustavlja mjerač vremena i otkazuje svaki povratni poziv na čekanju."

#: ../../library/machine.Timer.rst:62
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstante"

#: ../../library/machine.Timer.rst:67
msgid "Pass to ``mode`` so the timer fires once and then stops."
msgstr ""
"Proslijedite parametru ``mode`` kako bi se mjerač vremena okinuo jednom i "
"zatim stao."

#: ../../library/machine.Timer.rst:72
msgid ""
"Pass to ``mode`` so the timer fires repeatedly at ``period`` intervals."
msgstr ""
"Proslijedite parametru ``mode`` kako bi se mjerač vremena opetovano okidao u"
" intervalima ``period``\\ ."
